{
  "name": "Telecom Tools MCP - Customer Care",
  "displayName": "Telecom Tools MCP - Customer Care",
  "description": "Telecom Customer Care: look up subscribers, lines, usage, bills, outages and device financing; change plans, add roaming passes, swap SIMs, book technicians, open trouble tickets and credit bill charges (gateway limit $50). No plan finance or network analytics.",
